id: 3
hanzi: 艘
pinyin: sōu
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Measure Word

meanings_summary:
  en: classifier for boats, ships, and oceanic vessels
  es: clasificador para barcos, buques y embarcaciones

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Measure Word | Standard | standard numerical classifier for sea-going ships, warships, boats, and large vessels | clasificador para embarcaciones marítimas y barcos | 一艘轮船 (a steamship)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 港口里停泊着一艘艘远洋货轮，等待着工人们装卸来自五大洲的集装箱。 | Gǎngkǒu lǐ tíngbó zhe yì sōusōu yuǎnyáng huòlún, děngdài zhe gōngrénmen zhuāngxiè láizì wǔdàzhōu de jízhuāngxiāng. | Ocean-going cargo freighters were moored in the harbor, waiting for dockworkers to unload containers from five continents. | En el puerto descansaban buques de carga transoceánicos, a la espera de que los operarios descargaran contenedores llegados de los cinco continentes.
  #2 | 海军最新服役的一艘驱逐舰顺利完成了长达半年的护航与搜救演练任务。 | Hǎijūn zuìxīn fúyì de yì sōu qūzhújiàn shùnlì wánchéng le chángdá bàn nián de hùháng yǔ sōujiù yǎnliàn rènwu. | A newly commissioned navy destroyer successfully completed a half-year escort and search-and-rescue drill mission. | El flamante destructor incorporado por la marina completó con éxito una misión semestral de escolta y simulacros de salvamento marítimo.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
